[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13921.03, "timestamp": "03:52:01", "text": "所以第一个主要按钮将是“创建”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13925.349, "timestamp": "03:52:05", "text": "创建了 V 循环同步中间那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13929.429, "timestamp": "03:52:09", "text": "所以它的作用就是让我展示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13932.71, "timestamp": "03:52:12", "text": "你是我的 Notification 页面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13936.15, "timestamp": "03:52:16", "text": "这是 YouTube 的 Notation 页面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13939.189, "timestamp": "03:52:19", "text": "播放列表单词循环。所以，在这里你可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13943.51, "timestamp": "03:52:23", "text": "查看我所有的 YouTube 播放列表"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13946.79, "timestamp": "03:52:26", "text": "我的YouTube频道将会发布内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13950.229, "timestamp": "03:52:30", "text": "这边。即使我创建了一个新的直播流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13955.03, "timestamp": "03:52:35", "text": "或者每当创建此播放列表时都会创建一个新的播放列表。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13959.189, "timestamp": "03:52:39", "text": "水循环同步按钮会运行它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13963.11, "timestamp": "03:52:43", "text": "全面彻底的检查。它会怎样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13966.95, "timestamp": "03:52:46", "text": "基本上，它会循环往复。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13972.15, "timestamp": "03:52:52", "text": "每个 YouTube 播放列表键。所以它使用"}]